    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căprĭmulgus</span></b> ,
		i, m.
		caper-mulgeo. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A milker of goats</i>, <b>poet.</b> for <i>countryman</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 22,
			10</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A bird supposed to suck the udders of goats</i>,
				<i>the goat-sucker</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10,
				40, 56, § 115</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
